- 2026-10-22T10:31:16+00:00 — Added focused planner-gate tests for malformed tag detection and retry-attempt incrementing to prevent repeat-cache loops on identical invalid planner outputs.
- 2026-10-22T10:50:01+00:00 — Made LLM calls resilient to model groups that reject custom temperature values by automatically retrying with provider-default temperature, preventing runtime failures during agent streaming and sync calls.
- 2026-10-26T07:41:37+00:00 — Restored visible chat execution activity after the unified dispatcher change: every LLM call now drives the bottom thinking status, and direct/planned tool and subagent calls stream their parameters and results again.
